    {
      "id": "build",
      "title": "Build",
      "body": "Then it writes the code, in an isolated copy of the project, and runs the project's own tests. It does not take the agent's word that they passed; the tests are run again here, and that result is the one that counts. What comes back is not a receipt. It is your change, running on a copy of the real app, with the switch already flipped on in the link so you can actually see it. While the checks run, nothing needs you.",
