      "title": "Ship",
      "body": "The yes you just gave is the one that merges it. That is safe to ask for once, because every change arrives with its feature flag off in both environments — merging moves the code, it does not release the feature. Only then does it show you what it did and ask you to sign off. Turning the flag on is a separate decision, made later, by a person, outside all of this.",
