    {
      "id": "your-turn",
      "title": "Your turn",
      "body": "Five steps, and a person decided every one of them. The cost is on the page the whole way, because a system that hides what it spends is asking to be trusted instead of checked. None of this makes an agent safer to leave alone. It makes being wrong cheap, and it keeps clear ownership of every decision. You can go and run one yourself, or read the whole thing — it is open source.",
